WEBVTT

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:33.260
<i>"It's deep into autumn.</i>

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.280
<i>I wonder what my neighbors do."</i>

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.060
<i>Nah.</i>

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.750
<i>Hinata lives next door.</i>

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:43.240
<i>I came to hang out with 
Hinata after school today.</i>

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.200
<i>Autumn scenery is all around us.</i>

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.540
<i>It feels nice.</i>

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:51.000
Welcome, Aoi-chan.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.670
Thanks for having me.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.670
Here you go. Earl Gray.

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.510
Thank you!

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:58.930
Huh?

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:00.990
Coffee?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:03.220
Yup. Dad got me into it.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.480
I tried mountain coffee 
one day, and I was hooked.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.730
Mountain coffee?

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.190
Drinking coffee on the mountains.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.770
That's exactly what it sounds like.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:18.990
The coffee you have on the mountain peaks, 
with the wind blowing on you, is exquisite.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:23.240
I think I'll try it sometime.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:26.250
<i>Hinata is going to do 
something that grown-up?</i>

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.080
I want to try mountain coffee, too!

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.260
Can you drink coffee, though, Aoi?

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.450
It's fine!

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:39.510
Let's do mountain coffee!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.760
O-Okay.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.800
Okay, I'll teach you how to make coffee.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.120
Thank you!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:47.290
Come with me.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.430
Okay!

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:53.450
What's gotten into her?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.990
<b>What Does Coffee Taste Like?</b>

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.990
Thank you, especially for 
lending me the equipment.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:00.860
I chose the beans that I like personally.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.590
You should try some different 
ones if you don't like those.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:05.620
Okay.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.330
Keep Sunday free, Hinata.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.550
It's coming out.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.970
That's not something I see you do often.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.380
I'm doing mountain coffee with Hinata.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.800
It's practice for that.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.110
I wish you would work just 
as hard on your studies.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:28.310
Oh, I think it's ready now.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.310
That looks good.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.510
Let's try it.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:42.660
So bitter!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:46.320
I wonder if I made it wrong.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.140
Let's see.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.810
My, it's delicious.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.080
Really?

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.560
It's rich and smooth.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:03:59.990
<i>Weird.</i>

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.430
I chose the beans that I like personally.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.010
<i>Maybe they aren't the right beans.</i>

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.260
<i>All right.</i>

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.220
<i>I'll go buy some tomorrow.</i>

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.260
I can't sleep.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.090
Is this the power of caffeine?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:23.100
One sheep, two sheep...

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.730
I've never been in a coffee shop before.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:33.010
Oh?

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.760
You can't even walk into a coffee shop?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.290
You're such a child.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.340
Shush, jeez!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.950
I can.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.340
I can go in.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.950
All this?

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:52.850
These are all beans?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:56.850
Willow Blend, Kenya, Guatemala...

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.650
Coarse grind?

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.770
Wait, is this sausage?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:05.110
High roast, unwashed...

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.580
I can't!

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.280
Aoi-chan!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.120
Hey!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.310
Kaede-san and Yuka-san.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:18.670
And that's why I'm learning about coffee.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.630
Mountain coffee?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.080
Lucky.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:24.010
I want to go hiking, too.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.910
Once we're done studying.

00:05:25.910 --> 00:05:28.090
We're getting to page 137 today.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.470
You monster.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.820
Monster coffee.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.100
Did you say something?

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.050
Nothing.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.540
But Aoi-chan, don't you usually have tea?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:39.610
I do.

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:41.360
Coffee is...

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.000
So bitter.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.870
It is at first.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:50.240
You'll come to like it 
when you get used to it.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:53.110
Why don't you try some sugar or milk?

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.780
Café au lait would be good, too.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.160
Latte art and stuff.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.060
But...

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:02.540
You put milk in it? You're such a kid.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:08.180
I feel like trying black to 
start with, like a cool person.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.570
I don't think you could enjoy

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:14.310
drinking something you 
don't like just to look cool.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:18.800
I think you're cooler if you 
can say you like what you like,

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:20.310
no matter what anyone else says.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:23.170
I like the mountains more than studying.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.440
How's that? Am I cool?

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.280
Be quiet.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.950
Why don't you try looking for 
the right coffee for yourself?

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.580
I will.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:35.950
109 sheep, 110 sheep...

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.730
<i>Then, the next Sunday,</i>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:42.370
<i>Hinata and I set out to Nishi-Agano 
Station on the Seibu-Chichibu Line.</i>

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.950
Didn't get enough sleep?

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.840
Nah, I'm fine.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.170
<b>Hanno</b>

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.220
<b>Ikebukuro</b>

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:48.590
<b>Mt. Tenran</b>

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.680
<i>To the Kanhasshu Observation Platform we go.</i>

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.590
<b>Agano</b>

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.090
<b>O-ichou</b>

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:49.760
<b>Nishi-Agano</b>

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:50.590
<b>Chichibu</b>

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.220
<b>Takayama 
Fudo-son</b>

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:51.090
<b>About two hours away</b>

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.220
<b>Kanhasshu Observation Platform</b>

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.220
<i>That's where we'll do mountain coffee.</i>

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.720
<b>Takayama Fudo Panorama Course</b>

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.720
<b>Kanhasshu</b>

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.630
Aoi, want me to carry the coffee gear?

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:08.360
Why?

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.430
No reason.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.820
Only if you want me to.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.140
Yes, please, then.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.180
Sure.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.230
Okay, let's go.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.490
Thanks.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:27.880
<b>Takayama Fudo-son</b>

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:27.880
<b>One of the three 
great Kanto Acalas</b>

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:25.860
Takayama Fudo-son.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:28.630
I never knew there was such 
an amazing temple here.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.760
So many stone steps...

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:33.880
Since we're here, we should go visit it.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.220
Okay.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.430
It's so high up.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:41.340
Take a look, Aoi.

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:43.190
I'll never look!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.070
<b>Kanhasshu 
Observation Platform</b>

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.910
I bet you could make good coffee with this.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.600
Whoops...

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.810
Now, then, just a little farther.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.920
Let's do this!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.050
<b>Kanto Social Path</b>

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.050
<b>Kanhasshu Observation Platform</b>

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:12.090
<i>Then, two hours after we started climbing...</i>

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:19.310
We made it!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.060
<b>Kanhasshu Observation Platform</b>

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.060
<b>Saitama Prefecture Environmental Agency</b>

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.940
It's such a nice view.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:26.810
They don't call it the Kanhasshu 
Observation Platform for nothing.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:30.070
All right, I'm going to make some coffee.

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.490
That does it for hot water.

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:39.740
Next, the beans...

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:41.640
Something like that?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.250
Want me to help with anything?

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.000
Nah, don't worry.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.220
Really?

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:50.420
Close the lid on the grinder, 
put the handle on it, and turn.

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.890
Which one is Mt. Fuji?

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.520
There.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.230
Once the coffee's done grinding, 
put a filter on top of the dripper,

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.700
and put the grounds on top.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.740
A little hot water,

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.780
and let steam for thirty seconds or so.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.750
Add more hot water.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.350
There. Done!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.990
It's ready!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:47.740
Here you go.

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.010
Thanks.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.830
How is it?

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.960
Yeah, it's nice and light.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:04.120
I like this, too.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.430
Really?

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.010
I'm glad.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:20.550
<i>The richness spreads through my 
mouth, and the scent has depth.</i>

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.640
<i>But...</i>

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.060
<i>It's still bitter.</i>

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.190
<i>I wonder if this is what adulthood is like.</i>

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.060
<i>I don't get it yet.</i>

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:32.590
You looked like a pro, Aoi.

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.750
You must have practiced a lot last night.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.640
I bet that's why you didn't sleep well.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.780
That was just because of the caffeine!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.200
Want me to carry the coffee gear?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.690
<i>Oh, so that's why she...</i>

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.790
Okay, let's go.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:50.060
<i>I made Hinata go out of her way for me.</i>

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.550
What's up?

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.150
Um, er...

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:56.060
There's a lot to learn about coffee, huh?

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:59.090
Don't worry, you'll get the taste eventually.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.530
You think so?

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:02.180
That's how it goes.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.220
Hey, what's that?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.060
It's milk.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:09.850
It's huge!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.390
Wait, why?

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:12.490
Why?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.170
Because black is so bitter.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:15.070
What?!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.000
You might as well make it taste good, right?

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.510
What's gotten into her?

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.710
Come on!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.430
You called me a kid for putting milk in it!

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.580
I never said that.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.410
Here, you can have some, Aoi.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:49.820
<i>There's no sense in trying to 
be more grown-up than I am.</i>

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:52.890
<i>I guess I'm still a kid.</i>

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:56.820
<i>Oh, that goes for Hinata, too, though.</i>

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.940
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.270
To be continued.
